$ sqlplus -S "sys/oracle as sysdba" @test_system_wallet.sql
(VM: Oracle AI Database 26ai Free / Oracle Linux 8 ; DB: 23.26.0.0.0 ; run as SYS ; 2026-09-23)
Part 2 (A-G) run after: bash setup_tls_servers.sh  (openssl s_server on 8543/8544/8545/8546)

